{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "55d8dd3c-6750-8c6e-a680-c63dbe2ddc56",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:06:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello, Greg. Tony Cardillo here. I'm, uh, I'm on the speaker, I've got my hands busy, so tell me if I'm too faint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I can hear you fine. What can I do for you, Tony?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, so, I got a vegetable garden out back, and the deer have been through it, wicked bad, ate everything down to the stems. So I want to put up a fence. Vinyl, four feet tall. And I'm not sure if I need a, a permit for that, or if that's, you know, something you just do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally speaking, a fence does need a permit here, yes. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "202 Gibbs Avenue. Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So, a vinyl fence, four feet, around the garden in the back yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Around the garden. Hold on, what's a seven-letter word for... no, never mind, I'm doing the crossword here while I wait, sorry. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Yeah, you'd want to file a permit application before anything goes up. Even at four feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So who does that, me or the contractor? I got a fella coming to do the install, but I don't know if he pulls the permit or if that's on me, the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one can, honestly. A lot of contractors will handle it for you, but you should ask him up front. If he's doing it, make sure it's in writing. If he's not, you'd file it as the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. So I ask him. Okay. But then if he does it, is it still my permit? Or his?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's still for your property. The application lists who's doing the work, so it'd show him as the contractor and you as the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I think I follow. Sort of. [pause] Huh, it's eleven letters, that one. Sorry, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine. Anything else on the fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, how close to the property line can I go? Because my neighbor, he's got the shed kind of near the back, and I don't want any trouble. Can I put it right up on the line? Or do I have to pull it in some?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's usually a setback, so you typically can't just assume the line. And I'd want you to have your survey or plot plan handy so it's drawn right on the application. Where the fence sits compared to the line is something they'll look at when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not, like, one number, it depends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can depend on the zone and where on the lot it is. I can have someone from the office confirm the exact distance for your lot. Want me to take a message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, yeah, I guess. Because I thought you'd just say two feet or three feet, and that's that. I'm a little lost now, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Give me a number and I'll have somebody call you back with the setback for your lot and where to get the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-eight. Got it. Tony Cardillo, 202 Gibbs, vinyl fence at four feet, asking about the setback. And you'll check with your contractor on the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I'll ask him. Though if he says it's me, I'll be calling back probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Call anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T15:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Greg. Appreciate it. I think. [pause] Oh, 'meticulous.' That's it. Okay, bye now."
    }
  ],
